    "factsheet": [
        {
            "heading": "The Arches Artist Spaces",
            "paragraphs": [
                "The Arches invites you to explore its artists' work and exhibitions within an engaging and vibrant environment, redesigned by A347 two years ago. This thoughtfully crafted spatial design continues to emphasise a community-centric atmosphere for artists, offering dedicated areas for cultural production around a central communal hub. The open and accessible layout encourages collaboration and interaction, transforming artistic creation into a powerful tool for community engagement and strengthening connections within the London Community Network. During the Open House, you can meet the artists in their creative spaces, experience their work firsthand, and even make purchases directly from them. This distinctive setup enhances the relationship between art, artists, and the surrounding community.",
                "Participating artists include:",
                "NILS EDELMAN: Painter, Ceramicist, Sculptor, Mosaicist - nilsedelmanart.co.uk - @nilstheartist",
                "DAVID MCCAIRLEY: Photographer - www.63406cad22a1a.site123.me - @davidmccairley",
                "COLIN MCCALLUM: Artist - www.colinmccallum.com - @colinmccallumart",
                "JOSIE HARGREAVES: Artist/Textiles - josiehargreaves.myportfolio.com - @hosay_j",
                "APPARAN: Street Artist/Spray paint artist - www.apparan.com - @apparan",
                "BETH COCKCROFT - @bethcockcroftart",
                "SAM MILLS - www.sam-mills.art - @samstudioart"
            ]
        }
    ],
